V5-哔哩哔哩信息流 = type=http-response,pattern=^https?:\/\/app\.bilibili\.com\/x\/v2\/feed\/index(?:\/story)?\/?(?:\?|$),requires-body=true,max-size=4194304,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Feng-Feng1/surge/main/AdBlock-AppClean-V5.txt?v=5.1.0-rc2,argument=bili&debug=1,timeout=10,script-update-interval=86400
V5-哔哩哔哩番剧广告 = type=http-response,pattern=^https?:\/\/api\.bilibili\.com\/pgc\/page\/bangumi\/?(?:\?|$),requires-body=true,max-size=4194304,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Feng-Feng1/surge/main/AdBlock-AppClean-V5.txt?v=5.1.0-rc2,argument=bili&debug=1,timeout=10,script-update-interval=86400
